    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just that i'm sad. it's like i'm not even really here. i go through the motions, i talk to people, i smile... but everything feels so fake. like i'm watching a movie of someone else's life. and the worst part is that i know i should be grateful, so i just feel guilty on top of everything else. it's like i'm stuck in this loop of nothingness that just never, ever ends.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
